OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThis evening
OL,6,Fwill see scattered showers, mainly in
OL,7,Fthe west. Then showers will become
OL,8,Ffewer and lighter during the early
OL,9,Fhours. Fresh westerly winds down.
OL,10,
OL,11,CFriday:FStarting off dry. Rain will
OL,12,Fspread from the west during the late
OL,13,Fmorning and afternoon, turning light
OL,14,Fand patchy later.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FMostly
OL,17,Fdry, bright and breezy on Saturday,
OL,18,Fchance of a few showers across
OL,19,FLothian. Dry for most of Sunday but
OL,20,Fchance of rain later. Early rain on
OL,21,FMonday then dry.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
